    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 2:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sasesiphenduka, saqonda enkangala ngendlela eya oLwandle oluBomvu, njengokutsho kweNkosi kimi; sazula entabeni yaseSeyiri insuku ezinengi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.2.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.2.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "NUM.21.4"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Nani 21:4",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.2.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.2.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 2:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "INkosi yasikhuluma kimi isithi: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.2.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.2.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 2:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sekuyisikhathi eside lizula entabeni lezi; phendukani, liye ngasenyakatho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.2.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.2.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 2:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Balaye abantu uthi: Selizakudabula ilizwe lezihlobo zenu, abantwana bakaEsawu abakhileyo eSeyiri. Bazakulesaba, ngakho linanzelele,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.2.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.2.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "GEN.36.8"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Gen 36:8",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.2.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.2.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 2:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ukuba lingalwi labo; kangisoze ngilinike ilizwe labo, atshi bo! ngitsho lendawo elingana lonyawo nje, ngoba ngimnikile uEsawu intaba zaseSeyiri zibe ngezakhe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.2.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.2.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 2:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lizakuthenga ukudla kubo ukuba lidle, lithenge kubo lamanzi ukuba linathe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.2.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.2.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 2:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngoba iNkosi uNkulunkulu wenu ilibusisile emsebenzini wonke wezandla zenu; ililondolozile ekuhambeni kwenu kulinkangala enkulu. INkosi uNkulunkulu wenu ibe lani liminyaka engamatshumi amane, kaliswelanga lutho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.2.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.2.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 2:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngakhoke saqhubeka, sadlula izihlobo zethu, abantwana bakaEsawu abakhileyo eSeyiri, satshiya indlela yaseAraba esuka eElathi leEziyoni‐Geberi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.2.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.2.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 2:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Saphenduka, sahamba ngendlela eya enkangala yaseMowabi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.2.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.2.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 2:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "INkosi yasisithi kimi: Ungabakhathazi abaseMowabi, ungalwi labo; ngoba kangisoze ngikunike ilizwe labo libe ngelakho, ngoba ngibanikile abantwana bakaLoti iAri ibe yindawo yabo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.2.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.2.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "GEN.19.37"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Gen 19:37",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.2.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.2.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 2:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "— Kwakuhlala khona endulo amaEmi, abantu abanengi, abakhulu, labade njengamaAnaki; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.2.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.2.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 2:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "njengamaAnaki laba kwakuthiwa ngamaRefa, kodwa abaseMowabi bababiza ngokuthi ngamaEmi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.2.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.2.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 2:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "LamaHori ayehlala eSeyiri endulo, kodwa abantwana bakaEsawu bawaxotsha, bawachitha phambi kwabo, bakha endaweni yawo, njengokwenza kukaIsrayeli elizweni lakubo elaliyilifa abalinikwa yiNkosi. — ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.2.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.2.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 2:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sukanike, liwele umfula iZeredi. Ngakhoke sawela umfula iZeredi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.2.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.2.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 2:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwasekudlule iminyaka engamatshumi amathathu lesificaminwembili kusukela ekusukeni kwethu eKadeshi‐Barneya kuze kube sekuweleni kwethu umfula iZeredi, kwaze kwaphela sonke isizukulwana samadoda empi ezihonqweni, njengokufunga kweNkosi kuwo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.2.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.2.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "NUM.14.28+NUM.14.29+NUM.14.30+NUM.14.31+NUM.14.32+NUM.14.33+NUM.14.34+NUM.14.35"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Nani 14:28–35",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.2.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.2.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 2:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngoba impela isandla seNkosi sasimelene lawo, sawachitha ezihonqweni, aze aphela.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.2.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.2.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 2:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.2.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.2.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 2:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwathi esefile amadoda empi wonke phakathi kwabantu, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.2.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.2.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 2:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "iNkosi yathi kimi: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.2.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.2.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 2:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lamhlanje uzakweqa umkhawulo waseMowabi eAri, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.2.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.2.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 2:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "lapho usufikile elizweni labantwana bakaAmoni, ungabakhathazi, ungalwi labo, ngoba kangisoze ngikunike ilizwe labo ukuba libe ngelakho, ngoba ngibanikile lona abantwana bakaLoti.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.2.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.2.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "GEN.19.38"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Gen 19:38",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.2.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.2.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 2:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "— Lalelo kuthiwa yilizwe lamaRefa, ngoba wona ayehlala khona endulo, kodwa abaseAmoni bawabiza ngokuthi ngamaZamuzumu; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.2.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.2.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 2:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ayengabantu abanengi, abakhulu, labade njengamaAnaki; kodwa iNkosi yawachitha phambi kwabo, labantwana bakaAmoni bawaxotsha, bakha endaweni yawo, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.2.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.2.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 2:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "njengalokho eyakwenzela abantwana bakaEsawu abakhileyo eSeyiri, yawachitha amaHori phambi kwabo, bawaxotsha, bakha endaweni yawo kuze kube lamuhla. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.2.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.2.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 2:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "LamaAvi lawo, ayehlala emizaneni eyayiseduze leGaza, anqotshwa ngamaKafitori avela eKafitori, akha endaweni yawo. — ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.2.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.2.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 2:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sukanike, lihambe lichaphe umfula iArinoni. Khangelani, nginikele ezandleni zenu uSihoni umAmori, inkosi yaseHeshiboni, kanye lelizwe lakhe; qalani ukulinqoba ilizwe, lilwe laye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.2.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.2.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 2:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kusukela lamhla ngizakwenza abantu bonke abangaphansi komthunzi welanga batshaywe luvalo, balesabe, lokuthi lapho besizwa ngani bathuthumele, baqhaqhazele ngenxa yenu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.2.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.2.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 2:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.2.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.2.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 2:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngasengithuma izigijimi kuSihoni inkosi yaseHeshiboni, zisuka enkangala yaseKedemothi, zilamazwi okuthula, ngathi: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.2.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.2.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 2:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akungivumele ukuba ngidabule phakathi kwelizwe lakho; ngizahamba ngomgwaqo, ngingaphambukeli ngakwesokunene loba ngakwesokhohlo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.2.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.2.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 2:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uzakungithengisela ukudla ukuba ngidle, ungithengisele lamanzi ukuba nginathe; ungivumele ukuba ngidlule nje kuphela, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.2.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.2.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 2:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "njengalokhu benza njalo abantwana bakaEsawu abakhileyo eSeyiri labaseMowabi abakhileyo eAri, ngizachapha iJordani, ngingene elizweni esinike lona iNkosi uNkulunkulu wethu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.2.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.2.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 2:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kodwa uSihoni inkosi yaseHeshiboni kayisivumelanga ukuba sidlule; ngoba iNkosi uNkulunkulu wenu yenza umoya wakhe waba lukhuni, lenhliziyo yakhe yaba lenkani, ukuze imnikele ezandleni zenu njengalamhlanje. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.2.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.2.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 2:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "INkosi yathi kimi: Khangela, lamhla sengiqalile ukunikela uSihoni lelizwe lakhe kuwe; qala ukuhlasela, ukuba ilizwe lakhe libe ngelakho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.2.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.2.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 2:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwasekuphuma uSihoni labantu bakhe bonke ukusihlasela eJahazi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.2.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.2.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 2:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "INkosi uNkulunkulu wethu yamnikela kithi: samnqoba yena lamadodana akhe labantu bakhe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.2.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.2.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 2:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngalesosikhathi sathumba yonke imizi yakhe, sayichitha yonke, sabulala abesilisa labesifazana labantwana; kasitshiyanga muntu; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.2.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.2.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 2:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "sathumba inkomo kuphela, zaba yimpango yethu; saphanga lemizi esayinqobayo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.2.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.2.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 2:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kusukela eAroweri eliseduze lesihotsha saseArinoni, lasemzini osesihotsheni, kuze kube seGileyadi kwakungekho muzi owasahlula ngenxa yokuphakama kwawo. INkosi uNkulunkulu wethu yayinikela yonke ezandleni zethu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.2.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.2.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 2:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kodwa kasisondelanga elizweni labantwana bakaAmoni, lasezinkunjini zomfula iJaboki, lasemizini yasezintabeni, lalapho iNkosi uNkulunkulu wethu eyasinqabela khona.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.2.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.2.37"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
